---
/* Shown at the top of every legal page.

   These pages are drafts written to the right shape, not legal advice, and
   they have not been reviewed by an attorney. Saying so on the page is both
   the honest thing and the safe thing — a privacy policy that makes promises
   the business has not agreed to is a liability, not a compliance measure.

   DELETE THIS COMPONENT'S USAGE once each page has been signed off. Do not
   delete the component until all three are done. */
---

<div class="notice" role="note">
  <p class="t-body-sm">
    <strong>Draft: awaiting legal review.</strong>
    <slot />
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .notice {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--surface-sunken);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
  }

  .notice p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
